Copyright 2026 Online Video LLM Testbed contributors

This product includes modified software from the Dispider project:
https://github.com/Mark12Ding/Dispider

Dispider is associated with the paper:
"Dispider: Enabling Video LLMs with Active Real-Time Interaction via
Disentangled Perception, Decision, and Reaction", Rui Qian et al., CVPR 2025.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.03218

The upstream source was distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Files in this repository have been modified, including package naming,
inference compatibility, evaluation tooling, and the online testbed.

This project also builds on concepts and components from LLaVA, Qwen2, CLIP,
Transformers, PyTorch, aiortc, FFmpeg, and their respective dependencies.
Those projects and model weights remain subject to their own licenses.
